Copyright (c) 2026 cachy-asahi contributors. MIT License; see LICENSE.

Original project packaging and launcher retain three exact original MIT files:
support_bundle.py, session_probe.py and the Doctor2 command (source name
doctor.py). Original copyright and SPDX headers are preserved. All three use
Python's standard library. See source-provenance.json for byte hashes, origins,
selection revision and the uncommitted original support-command proposal.

The support command uses only offline parsing/validation/comparison APIs from
the private modules. Importing them does not invoke their live collectors.
This package has no relation to official CachyOS/Asahi approval or affiliation.
No native ARM, ALPM installation, physical M2 or release qualification is claimed.
